      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "And tbh whole instances UI is not informative at all.\n\n- The numbers say nothing about instance. It's minor information, that might be moved on the second line with server location and number of users.\n\n- Each instance on a pic is group public, but 0 info about what group is shown. Users need to click each button to find necessary instance or figure out group.\n\n- Scrolling is broken. Each click rolls instance listing back to beginning.\n\nAlso, please, take those related issues into account:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/group-public-moderation\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/world-owners-should-be-able-hide-group-public-instance\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/do-not-automatically-select-a-group-public-instance\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/replace-group-public-with-the-group-name-in-instance-list",
